  "description": "(3.0.1) Speech + OCR contract surface for CircleAI. ISpeechRecognizer (ASR) + ISpeechSynthesizer (TTS) + IWakeWordDetector (KWS, e.g. \"Hey B\") + IOpticalCharacterRecognizer (OCR). Null implementations ship out of the box; real backends — FunASR (Alibaba, Apache 2.0) for ASR, ChatTTS for TTS, Hey-Snips-pattern KWS, PaddleOCR (Baidu, Apache 2.0), plus yapsnap (Apache 2.0) as an ASR supplement — land in 2.3.1 when the runtimes are vendored. Wires B! Butler voice surface end-to-end on-device.",
